V","c":[]},{"h":"Short Circuit and Overcharge Protection","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty: 1 Year","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Specification","active":true,"cls":"tab-1","noExpand":false,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Description","active":false,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p></p><p></p><h2>MARSRIVA MR-US3K - Energy Efficient 3KVA ONLINE UPS</h2><p></p><p></p><p>The MARSRIVA MR-US3K 3KVA Online UPS, now available at dcores.net, is your go-to solution for energy-efficient, reliable power backup. Designed for servers, workstations, and networking devices, the MR-US3K offers high efficiency, achieving up to 95.5% in AC mode. This UPS ensures the protection of your critical equipment with its pure sine wave output, providing clean and stable power, while safeguarding against overload, short circuits, and more.</p><p>Whether you're running a small business or need backup power for sensitive electronics, this 3KVA online UPS from MARSRIVA is built to deliver uninterrupted performance.</p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li>Energy-Efficient: Achieve 95.5% efficiency in AC mode, reducing power consumption and operating costs.</li><li>Pure Sine Wave Output: Compatible with sensitive equipment like servers, computers, and communication systems.</li><li>Comprehensive Protection: Safeguards against overload, short circuits, overcharge, and over-discharge to ensure the longevity of both the UPS and connected devices.</li><li>Extended Battery Life: Features lead-acid batteries with up to 5 hours of recharge time and 15–30 minutes of runtime at full load.</li><li>Versatile Design: Available in both tower and rack-mounted options to suit your setup.</li><li>LCD Display: Monitor real-time status of battery and load with an easy-to-read LCD control panel.</li><li>Perfect for businesses in need of reliable backup power for critical systems, the MARSRIVA MR-US3K is the ideal energy-efficient UPS solution.</li></ul><h3>Specifications:</h3><ul><li>Capacity: 3KVA / 3KW</li><li>Efficiency: Up to 95.5% (AC mode), 91.5% (battery mode)</li><li>Output Voltage: 208V ~ 240V AC</li><li>Output Waveform: Pure sine wave</li><li>Communication Ports: RS232, USB, EPO</li><li>Form Factor: Tower</li><li>Weight: 20.5 kg</li></ul><p></p>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"KSTAR HP SERIES 3KVA ONLINE UPS (WITH 8PCS BATTERY, STANDARD BACKUP, FOR PC AND NETWORKING DEVICE ONLY)","href":"/kstar-hp-series-3kva-online-ups-with-8pcs-battery-standard-backup-for-pc-and-networking-device-only","now":"38,000৳","old":"39,100৳","single":""},{"name":"Must EH55-H3KRS 3KVA Online UPS","href":"/must-eh55-h3krs-3kva-online-ups","now":"40,000৳","old":"42,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Must EH55-H1K3 1KVA Online UPS","href":"/must-eh55-h1k3-1kva-online-ups","now":"21,500৳","old":"24,000৳","single":""},{"name":"APC Smart 1000VA online UPS","href":"/apc-smart-1000va-online-ups","now":"23,000৳","old":"25,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Must EH55-H3K8 3KVA Online UPS","href":"/must-eh55-h3k8-3kva-online-ups","now":"39,300৳","old":"40,200৳","single":""},{"name":"Must EH55-H1KS 1KVA Online UPS","href":"/must-eh55-h1ks-1kva-online-ups","now":"29,000৳","old":"31,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Must EH55-H3KR 3KVA Online UPS","href":"/must-eh55-h3kr-3kva-online-ups","now":"44,000৳","old":"4,500৳","single":""},{"name":"Marsriva MR-US6K Energy Efficient 6kVA Online UPS","href":"/marsriva-mr-us6k-energy-efficient-6kva-online-ups","now":"105,000৳","old":"108,500৳","single":""},{"name":"Must EH55-H3K6 3KVA Online UPS","href":"/must-eh55-h3k6-3kva-online-ups","now":"38,000৳","old":"40,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Marsiva MR-US1K Energy Efficient 1kVA Online UPS","href":"/marsiva-mr-us1k-energy-efficient-1kva-online-ups","now":"","old":"","single":"24,500৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"t